msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh, why do you look so sad? Was it＿that miserable...? No, that's not it...」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehm, ¿por qué te ves tan triste? ¿Fue＿tan miserable...? No, no es eso...」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you sad because you don't know＿how to answer? I'm sorry, Inko-chan!＿Forget I asked!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Estás triste porque no sabes＿cómo responder? ¡Perdón, Inko-chan!＿¡Olvida que pregunté!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Thief? I get it. \"One that lies will steal,\"＿right? Then Kawashima was trying to＿steal something from me......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ladrona? Ya entiendo. \"Quien miente,＿roba\", ¿verdad? ¿Entonces Kawashima＿intentaba robarme algo......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......No, no way.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No, ni hablar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm? Not gonna agree with me,＿Inko-chan? Well, you are a bird, after＿all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mmm? ¿No vas a darme la razón,＿Inko-chan? Bueno, al fin y al＿cabo eres un pájaro.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Maybe you can't comprehend the＿wonder that is Ami-chan -- I mean,＿Kawashima.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tal vez no puedas comprender la＿maravilla que es Ami-chan, digo,＿Kawashima.」"
